	(text "POWER: USB-C (5.1k CC) -> U1 MCP73831 charges the LiPo at 210 mA (R3 4.7k).\nPower path: USB -> D1 -> VSYS; USB unplugged -> R4 pulls Q1's gate low -> VBAT -> VSYS.\nU2 AP2112K-3.3 from VSYS. VBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 -> IO0, CHG_STAT -> IO1 (internal pull-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cd10870c-bd3f-5c43-bf46-b92c143b5e60")
	)
	(text "MIC: ICS-43434 on IO18/19/20 (SCK / WS / SD), bottom port through the board to the front grille.\nFirmware: 16 kHz I2S, RMS over 250 ms, three thresholds -> level 0-3 sent over ESP-NOW."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "db79c44a-1c02-5525-9153-5b802a8ea435")
	)
	(text "BUTTON on IO3 (LP GPIO, internal pull-up: wakes the C6). STATUS LED green on IO6.\nIO8 pulled high (R8); IO9 internal pull-up, TP1 pulls it low for recovery. USB on IO12/IO13."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "380574ba-daa6-5dab-9c79-b9b98658d732")
	)
